  endingNarrativeText: "The hyperdrive engaged with blinding fury \u2014 and collapsed
    inward.\nSpace-time folded back onto itself, slingshotting the vessel to Sector
    1.\n\nYou awaken shivering in the cockpit as suit life support reboots.\nOutside
    your visor, the radio monitor blinks with hundreds of distress beacons:\n491
    identical transponders broadcasting your exact signal (121.5 MHz).\n\nEvery derelict
    station in this abyss was repaired by your hands.\nEvery frozen corpse drifting
    in the void is you.\n\nYou have never escaped. The cycle begins anew."
